E_WORD","word":{"words":"《符文战场》第二赛季全国公开赛开赛在即，我们注意到各地玩家对于卡牌、规则和判罚差异备受关注，也在社区内听到一些关于禁卡的呼声。赛事团队始终致力于维护专业、透明的游戏环境，并且与设计师团队持续进行着紧密的沟通。\n今天《符文战场》游戏总监Dave Guskin，从设计师角度，在个人社交媒体上发布了这份说明——「关于规则更新和禁卡规划的说明」，与大家分享了未来的部分规划。\n经与设计师团队确认，在3月30日新规发布并生效之前，CN地区赛事的判决将优先参考官方小程序已发布的赛事规则、官方FAQ、裁判Q\u0026A和赛后判例等相关内容，并以现场主裁裁定为准。\n","font_size":17,"color":"","dark_color":"","style":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"background":""},"font_level":"regular","translated_words":"","bili_theme":"","bg_style":null},"rich":null,"formula":null,"user":null},{"type":"TEXT_NODE_TYPE_RICH","word":null,"rich":{"text":"#符文战场#","orig_text":"#符文战场#","type":"RICH_TEXT_NODE_TYPE_TOPIC","jump_url":"//search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=%E7%AC%A6%E6%96%87%E6%88%98%E5%9C%BA","icon_url":"","icon_name":"","rid":"","emoji":null,"goods":null,"style":null,"pics":[],"video":null},"formula":null,"user":null},{"type":"TEXT_NODE_TYPE_WORD","word":{"words":" ","font_size":17,"color":"","dark_color":"","style":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"background":""},"font_level":"regular","translated_words":"","bili_theme":"","bg_style":null},"rich":null,"formula":null,"user":null},{"type":"TEXT_NODE_TYPE_RICH","word":null,"rich":{"text":"#符文战场：英雄联盟对战卡牌#","orig_text":"#符文战场：英雄联盟对战卡牌#","type":"RICH_TEXT_NODE_TYPE_TOPIC","jump_url":"//search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=%E7%AC%A6%E6%96%87%E6%88%98%E5%9C%BA%EF%BC%9A%E8%8B%B1%E9%9B%84%E8%81%94%E7%9B%9F%E5%AF%B9%E6%88%98%E5%8D%A1%E7%89%8C","icon_url":"","icon_name":"","rid":"","emoji":null,"goods":null,"style":null,"pics":[],"video":null},"formula":null,"user":null},{"type":"TEXT_NODE_TYPE_WORD","word":{"words":" ","font_size":17,"color":"","dark_color":"","style":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"background":""},"font_level":"regular","translated_words":"","bili_theme":"","bg_style":null},"rich":null,"formula":null,"user":null},{"type":"TEXT_NODE_TYPE_RICH","word":null,"rich":{"text":"#符文